{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/01_title_disguise_ch2.png?t=1745430846\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u6f5c\u5165GIF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" /><br><strong>VIVA NOBOTS</strong> is a treasure-hunting stealth action game where humans (players) disguise themselves as excavation robots (NPCs) to sneak into ancient ruins.  <br>As a NOBOT \u2014 a treasure hunter in disguise \u2014 your goal is to get rich and rise to the top of the wanted rankings!<br><br>The key to being a successful NOBOT is <strong>\u201cCan you steal the treasure without blowing your cover?\u201d</strong>  <br>You can enter and leave the ruins at any time\u2014<br>but beware: <strong>you never know how many rival players might be lurking inside!</strong><br>Dig for treasure while blending in with the bots, and if you spot another player, expose them and steal their loot!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/02_title_steal.png?t=1745430846\" />  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u767a\u6398GIF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" />  <br><strong>Blend in with excavation robots and snatch treasures from ancient ruins!</strong>  <br>When three symbols align, treasure appears \u2014 time your dig carefully while keeping an eye on rivals!<br>The rarer the treasure, the stronger the buffs\u2014and the higher the points!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/03_title_expose.png?t=1745430846\" />  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u30c0\u30a6\u30c8GIF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" />  <br><strong>Spot a suspicious player? Use the Doubt Gun to reveal their true identity!</strong>  <br>Expose rivals to steal their treasure and earn bonus bounty rewards!  <br>But be careful \u2014 if you shoot a real NPC, you'll pay the price!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/05_title_escape.png?t=1745430846\" />  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u8131\u51faGIF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" /><br><strong>Even if you grab the treasure, you're not safe until you escape!</strong>  <br>If your identity is revealed by rivals or security bots, they'll snatch your loot!  <br>However, if you successfully identify all three rivals, you can make a daring escape via the <strong>&quot;Victory Lap&quot;</strong> \u2014 no exit required!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u30d3\u30af\u30c8\u30ea\u30fcGIFF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/16multi.png?t=1745430846\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Future Update Plans</h2>\u30fbCo-op / VS Mode<br>\u30fbA super rare jackpot event! Hit the &quot;GODPOT&quot; and score a massive payday!<br>\u30fbCollect golden maps to reach the legendary ruins &quot;Gol Dorado&quot; and claim the hidden treasure, Viva La Vida!<br>\u30fbFind the sneaky NPC Androids pretending to be NOBOTS!<br>\u30fbChange avatar type<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About \u201cPrivate Match\u201d (Test Version)</h2> This mode allows up to 16 players to play together with people they know.  <br>Treasures and medals collected in this mode cannot be taken back to the main game.  <br>Wins and losses do not affect experience points or rank, making it perfect for practice.  <br>Room time limit: 30 minutes.<br>Note: Inconvenient features in this test version are planned to be improved in the final version.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Network Settings</h2>You can change the server region from the sub-menu. <br>Try this if your connection or matchmaking is unstable.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u30ea\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u5909\u66f4EN_500.png?t=1745430846\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3104370?t=1745430846","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/405bb8a3610b616fd1b657a439929eedf9f98704/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745430846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/8b4fe4856097509e4a71d4f607b43179ab50be42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745430846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/8b4fe4856097509e4a71d4f607b43179ab50be42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745430846","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Playtest</h1><p><strong>Scheduled Test Period: April 24 (Thu) \u2013 May 8 (Thu), 2025</strong><br><br> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0fPlease Note:<br>This is a prototype title and has not yet been confirmed for official release.<br>Details such as launch date, pricing, and other information will be announced if and when the game is officially confirmed for release.<br><br>The game provided in this user test is under development and may include bugs or unfinished content.<br>We cannot guarantee full functionality during the testing period.</h2><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d0\u30c3\u30af_fix_EN.png?t=1745430846\" /><br>Depending on the feedback from this user test, we may be able to move forward toward an official release!<br><br>To all Steam users:<br>We\u2019d love for you to join the test and share your thoughts!<br>Our entire team is looking forward to your support!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/01_title_disguise_ch2.png?t=1745430846\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u6f5c\u5165GIF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" /><br><strong>VIVA NOBOTS</strong> is a treasure-hunting stealth action game where humans (players) disguise themselves as excavation robots (NPCs) to sneak into ancient ruins.  <br>As a NOBOT \u2014 a treasure hunter in disguise \u2014 your goal is to get rich and rise to the top of the wanted rankings!<br><br>The key to being a successful NOBOT is <strong>\u201cCan you steal the treasure without blowing your cover?\u201d</strong>  <br>You can enter and leave the ruins at any time\u2014<br>but beware: <strong>you never know how many rival players might be lurking inside!</strong><br>Dig for treasure while blending in with the bots, and if you spot another player, expose them and steal their loot!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/02_title_steal.png?t=1745430846\" />  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u767a\u6398GIF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" />  <br><strong>Blend in with excavation robots and snatch treasures from ancient ruins!</strong>  <br>When three symbols align, treasure appears \u2014 time your dig carefully while keeping an eye on rivals!<br>The rarer the treasure, the stronger the buffs\u2014and the higher the points!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/03_title_expose.png?t=1745430846\" />  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u30c0\u30a6\u30c8GIF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" />  <br><strong>Spot a suspicious player? Use the Doubt Gun to reveal their true identity!</strong>  <br>Expose rivals to steal their treasure and earn bonus bounty rewards!  <br>But be careful \u2014 if you shoot a real NPC, you'll pay the price!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/05_title_escape.png?t=1745430846\" />  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u8131\u51faGIF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" /><br><strong>Even if you grab the treasure, you're not safe until you escape!</strong>  <br>If your identity is revealed by rivals or security bots, they'll snatch your loot!  <br>However, if you successfully identify all three rivals, you can make a daring escape via the <strong>&quot;Victory Lap&quot;</strong> \u2014 no exit required!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u30d3\u30af\u30c8\u30ea\u30fcGIFF_steam.gif?t=1745430846\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/16multi.png?t=1745430846\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Future Update Plans</h2>\u30fbCo-op / VS Mode<br>\u30fbA super rare jackpot event! Hit the &quot;GODPOT&quot; and score a massive payday!<br>\u30fbCollect golden maps to reach the legendary ruins &quot;Gol Dorado&quot; and claim the hidden treasure, Viva La Vida!<br>\u30fbFind the sneaky NPC Androids pretending to be NOBOTS!<br>\u30fbChange avatar type<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About \u201cPrivate Match\u201d (Test Version)</h2> This mode allows up to 16 players to play together with people they know.  <br>Treasures and medals collected in this mode cannot be taken back to the main game.  <br>Wins and losses do not affect experience points or rank, making it perfect for practice.  <br>Room time limit: 30 minutes.<br>Note: Inconvenient features in this test version are planned to be improved in the final version.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Network Settings</h2>You can change the server region from the sub-menu. <br>Try this if your connection or matchmaking is unstable.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/extras/\u30ea\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u5909\u66f4EN_500.png?t=1745430846\" />","developers":["SHUEISHA GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104370/9d09a6b231f8fa997ff3ee2575ded37b1df637cf/header.jpg?t=1745430846","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9SHUEISHA GAMES","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126656,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126656/movie480.mp4?t=1744881387","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126656/movie_max.mp4?t=1744881387"},"name":"VIVA NOBOTS \u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126656/f6f88f41506e7be55a6e688d5f1e9181d184c798/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744881387","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126656/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744881387","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126656/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744881387"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257117229,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117229/movie480.mp4?t=1744881395","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117229/movie_max.mp4?t=1744881395"},"name":"Beg